OL,3,GNEWSAKatie Price's ex not guilty of
OL,4,Araping girl, 13
OL,5,
OL,6,FKatie Price's ex-husband, Kieran
OL,7,FHayler, has been found not guilty of
OL,8,Fraping a 13-year-old girl.
OL,10,FHayler, 39, has been on trial accused
OL,11,Fof rape and sexual assault against the
OL,12,Fgirl in West Sussex in 2016, when he
OL,13,Fwas married to the media personality.
OL,15,FIn total he was acquitted of three
OL,16,Fcounts of rape and one count of sexual
OL,17,Fassault at Lewes Crown Court.
OL,19,FHayler had also faced four alternative
OL,20,Fcounts of sexual activity with a child,
OL,21,Ffor which he was also found not guilty.
